      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The 'recently seen' used to have friends (only? or separated?, cant remember) and I loved that, adding back the separation is amazing, so if they do decide to change this again, I hope they make it an option to separate them, or at least have an 'overall' recent, as well as a separated recents for friends.",
